      "title": "白狼山之战",
      "title_en": "Battle of White Wolf Mountain",
      "year": 207,
      "month": 8,
      "category": "major_battle",
      "description": "曹操北征乌桓，郭嘉献策「兵贵神速」，轻装奇袭白狼山，斩蹋顿单于，收编乌桓骑兵，彻底扫平北方袁氏残余。此战之后曹操得以全力南顾。",
      "description_en": "Cao Cao campaigns north against the Wuhuan tribes. Guo Jia advises 'speed is the essence of war' — a lightning strike at White Wolf Mountain kills Tadun Chanyu. Cao Cao absorbs Wuhuan cavalry and eliminates the last Yuan clan remnants, securing his northern flank before turning south.",
      "participants": [
        "caocao",
        "guojia",
        "zhangliao",
        "caochun",
        "yuanshang",
        "yuanxi"
