    },
    {
      "id": "guojia_death_207",
      "title": "郭嘉病逝",
      "title_en": "Death of Guo Jia",
      "year": 207,
      "month": 9,
      "category": "character_death",
      "description": "郭嘉北征归途中病逝于易县，年仅三十八岁。曹操大恸：「唯奉孝为能知孤意。」临终遗策定辽东。若郭嘉尚在，必力谏曹操先固北方根本、缓图南征——赤壁之败或可避免。",
      "description_en": "Guo Jia dies of illness at Yixian, aged 38. Cao Cao is devastated: 'Only Fengxiao truly understood my mind.' His final stratagem secures Liaodong. Historians widely believe: had Guo Jia lived, he would have strongly advised against the hasty southern campaign — Red Cliffs might have been avoided.",
      "participants": [
        "guojia",
        "caocao"
      ],
      "gravity": 0.9,
      "preconditions": {
        "wuhuan_campaign_complete": true
      },
