      "category": "political",
      "description": "袁尚、袁熙逃奔辽东公孙康。公孙康畏惧曹操兵威，斩二袁首级奉送曹操。袁绍一族彻底覆灭，河北再无反抗势力。曹操从此无后顾之忧。",
      "description_en": "Yuan Shang and Yuan Xi flee to Gongsun Kang in Liaodong. Fearing Cao Cao's military might, Gongsun Kang executes both brothers and sends their heads to Cao Cao. The Yuan clan is extinguished; Hebei is fully pacified.",
